Origin
------
Original work, not a fork.

Artwork
-------
The eight weather glyphs in icons/weather/ (bolt, cloud, cloud-dark, fog, moon,
raindrop, snowflake, sun) were drawn for this project and are licensed
GPL-3.0-or-later with the rest of the repository. Each is a few lines of
absolute-integer SVG using <line>, <circle> and short path commands; no
third-party artwork was used as a source.

Weather data
------------
Forecasts and the preferences place search come from Open-Meteo
(https://open-meteo.com/), whose data is licensed under CC BY 4.0. The
extension credits it in its preferences.

